<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Special Milestone Achieved</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f0f4f8; font-family:
      'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333; } .container
      { max-width: 640px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius:
      14px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); overflow: hidden; }
      .header { background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; } .body { padding:
      35px 28px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; } .badge { font-size: 40px;
      text-align: center; color: #0c4a6e; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }
      .cta { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; } .cta a { background-color:
      #0c4a6e; color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 26px;
      font-weight: bold; border-radius: 6px; } .footer { background-color:
      #f5f6fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #888;
      border-top: 1px solid #ddd; } .footer a { color: #0c4a6e; text-decoration:
      none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        🌟 Big Milestone Unlocked!
      </div>
      <div class='body'>
        <p>Hey <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>You've officially crossed
          <span class='badge'>{{daysActive}} DAYS</span>
          of active use on EngageGPT!</p>
        <p>This is a huge achievement, and we couldn’t be more proud to have you
          with us on this journey.</p>
        <div class='cta'>
          <a href='https://engagegpt.in/dashboard' target='_blank'>Keep Growing
            🚀</a>
        </div>
        <p>Thank you for being an integral part of the EngageGPT community.</p>
        <p>Let’s break more records together!</p>
        <p>Warm regards,<br />The EngageGPT Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class='footer'>
        &copy;
        {{year}}
        EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
        <a href='https://engagegpt.in'>Website</a>
        |
        <a href='mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com'>Support</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>